# Away from home, the heap dips for a moment while Wi-Fi scans, and the books list task gets a refused
# allocation now and then. The list must still be the card's whole list, or say it couldn't read it:
# never a short list, never a crash. (Origin 2026-11-11: Julien's and Albie's devices showed only some
# books offline, and Julien's none after a reboot.) Needs the test card (CARD) with its 8 books.
wifi off
wait-text "HOME" 50000
flaky-alloc library 15
press 3
wait-text "Harry Potter 4" 15000
expect-text "Stinky Dragon - Extras"
expect-no-text "CARD NOT READ"
report listed
press down down down down down down down down
wait 500
expect-text "Season 3"
press enter
wait-text "Ep" 15000
expect-no-text "CARD NOT READ"
expect-no-text "NOT ON CARD"
report chapters listed
flaky-alloc off
